---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Autism Spectrum Disorder Psychiatric Care | Mind Menders | Towson MD"
  description="Specialized psychiatric care for children, teens, and adults with autism spectrum disorder. Matthew Mauro, PMHNP-BC. Towson, MD and telehealth statewide."
  activeNav="services"
>
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo; <a href="/services">Services</a> &rsaquo; <span>Autism Spectrum</span></nav>
    <span class="eyebrow-white">Condition</span>
    <h1>Autism Spectrum Disorder Psychiatric Care</h1>
    <p>Compassionate, specialized psychiatric support for individuals with autism &mdash; children through adults. Matthew Mauro brings deep clinical expertise and a personal commitment to the autism community.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">About ASD</span>
        <h2>Psychiatric Care for the Autism Community</h2>
        <p>Autism spectrum disorder (ASD) is a complex neurodevelopmental condition affecting social communication, behavior, and sensory processing. While autism itself is not a psychiatric disorder, individuals with autism frequently experience co-occurring mental health conditions &mdash; including anxiety, depression, ADHD, OCD, mood disorders, and sleep difficulties &mdash; that significantly affect quality of life.</p>
        <p>Psychiatric care for autistic individuals requires a specialized approach. Presentations of common conditions often look different in autism, medications may be tolerated differently, and treatment must account for communication styles, sensory sensitivities, and each person&rsquo;s unique strengths.</p>
        <p>Matthew Mauro has deep clinical expertise in this area and a personal commitment to the autism community. He approaches every patient with patience, respect, and a genuine effort to understand the world from their perspective.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:var(--sp-4)">Schedule an Appointment &#8594;</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="background:var(--teal-light);border-radius:var(--radius-xl);padding:var(--sp-8);border:1px solid var(--border)">
          <span class="eyebrow">Co-Occurring Conditions</span>
          <h3 style="margin-bottom:var(--sp-6)">Common Psychiatric Challenges in ASD</h3>
          <div class="condition-signs">
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Anxiety disorders (very common)</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>ADHD and attention challenges</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Depression and mood disorders</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>OCD and repetitive behaviors</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Sleep disturbances</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Self-injurious behavior</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Emotional dysregulation</p></div>
            <div class="sign-item"><div class="sign-check">&#10003;</div><p>Aggression or behavioral challenges</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-light">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:860px">
    <div class="section-header center"><span class="eyebrow">Our Approach</span><h2>Specialized Psychiatric Support for ASD</h2></div>
    <div class="treatment-list">
      <div class="treatment-item"><div class="treatment-icon">&#129490;</div><div><h4>ASD-Informed Psychiatric Evaluation</h4><p>Thorough assessment of co-occurring psychiatric conditions with full awareness of how autism affects symptom presentation, communication, and behavior. No assumptions &mdash; every patient is evaluated as an individual.</p></div></div>
      <div class="treatment-item"><div class="treatment-icon">&#128138;</div><div><h4>Careful Medication Management</h4><p>When medications are appropriate, Matthew selects and monitors them carefully &mdash; starting low, going slow, and closely tracking response and tolerance in the context of each patient&rsquo;s unique neurology.</p></div></div>
      <div class="treatment-item"><div class="treatment-icon">&#128100;</div><div><h4>Family-Centered Care</h4><p>For children and adolescents especially, Matthew works collaboratively with families &mdash; providing education, guidance, and support so that parents and caregivers are empowered partners in treatment.</p></div></div>
      <div class="treatment-item"><div class="treatment-icon">&#128172;</div><div><h4>Communication &amp; Sensory Accommodations</h4><p>Appointments are adapted to the communication style and sensory needs of each patient. We create a safe, comfortable, non-judgmental environment where every individual is respected.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Expert Autism Psychiatric Care</h2>
    <p>New patients welcome. Matthew is committed to the autism community &mdash; schedule today.</p>
    <div class="cta-phone"><a href="tel:4437987707">(443) 798-7707</a></div>
    <div class="cta-actions"><a href="/contact" class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Schedule Appointment</a><a href="/about" class="btn btn-outline-white btn-lg">About Matthew</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
